1:["$","$Le",null,{"reaction":{"id":"neutron","formula":"¹³C(α,n)¹⁶O","tag":["重元素的中子来源","A neutron source for heavy elements"],"title":["碳-13 为重元素合成提供中子","Carbon-13 supplies neutrons for heavy-element synthesis"],"text":["在渐近巨星支恒星中，碳-13 与 α 粒子反应并释放中子，为慢中子俘获过程提供重要中子源。许多比铁更重的元素在这一过程中逐步形成。","In asymptotic giant branch stars, carbon-13 reacts with alpha particles and releases neutrons. This is a major neutron source for the slow neutron-capture process that produces many elements heavier than iron."],"task":["测量低能反应截面，约束恒星中的中子产生率。","Measure low-energy cross sections to constrain neutron production in stars."],"type":["慢中子俘获过程","The s-process"],"product":"¹⁶O + n","input":"¹³C + α","particle":"n","tone":"cyan","publicProgress":["2022 年论文结合 CJPL 与四川大学测量，覆盖质心系能量 0.24–1.9 MeV，几乎完整覆盖 i 过程的伽莫夫窗口。","The 2022 study combines CJPL and Sichuan University measurements at centre-of-mass energies of 0.24–1.9 MeV, covering almost the entire i-process Gamow window."],"detector":["反应产生的中子经慢化后由 ³He 正比计数管阵列记录，结合探测效率确定反应产额。","Neutrons are moderated and counted by a ³He proportional-counter array; calibrated efficiency links the count rate to the reaction yield."],"references":["carbon-neutron-source-2022"]}}]
